<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan forex reserves jump to $1.704 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan forex reserves jump to $1.704 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan foreign exchange reserves rose to $1.704 billion dollar on June 21 from $1.690 billion on June 14, compared to $2.067 billion a year ago, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    (BLN DLRS)		  June 21    June 14   June 20, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL			     1.704	1.690     2.067</p>
<p>Forex in Pakistan	     0.758	0.803     0.713</p>
<p>Forex outside Pakistan	0.272	0.214     0.660</p>
<p>Gold coins and bullion	0.672	0.672     0.692</p>
<p>Special Drawing Rights	0.001	0.001     0.001</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
